WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.708
Hi! Last week was terrible. My family and I were sick!

2
00:00:07.158 --> 00:00:10.316
On Monday, I had a terrible headache.

3
00:00:12.566 --> 00:00:15.306
On Tuesday, I was sneezing all day.

4
00:00:17.556 --> 00:00:20.018
Then my husband had a bad cough.

5
00:00:22.268 --> 00:00:27.097
And on Wednesday, I had a fever: thirty-nine degrees!

6
00:00:27.547 --> 00:00:30.473
The doctor said: it's the flu.

7
00:00:32.723 --> 00:00:36.067
So we stayed at home and drank a lot of tea.

8
00:00:36.517 --> 00:00:40.325
Remember: when you're sick, you should rest!

